[size=5][b]Settings and blacklist[/b][/size]
The streamlined Bingus menu keeps Enable Mod, Mode, Sound feedback, Experimental layout, Preset, Select on Release and Input interval. Presets still work and saved appearance values are retained; vertical offset is disabled at zero.

[b]Blacklist SOS Beacon[/b] and [b]Blacklist Eagle Rearm[/b] are simple on/off options available on the ship. The optional MCM blacklist page adds other entries with confirmation. Equipped stratagems remain protected. Filtering affects ASS selection, not the game's actual availability.

[size=5][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Custom stratagems are missing entirely:[/b] verify the Compendium pack is installed, enabled and registered with HD2Runtime. ASS does not install that pack. Deploy with the game closed and restart. Start a fresh mission after a compatibility update.
[*][b]Older LLL discovery limitation:[/b] some loader builds do not discover Compendium's mixed-resource archive. This is separate from ASS's input compatibility. The minimal scanner correction is currently undergoing deployment verification; check the release notes before using that combination.
[*][b]Temporary HUD failure:[/b] close and reopen the stratagem menu. If it persists, preserve DiversBestFriend.log and include your mode/layout when reporting it.
[*][b]A code is rejected:[/b] check cooldown, remaining uses, jamming and normal game restrictions. Close and reopen the menu after manual or interrupted input.
[*][b]A game update breaks startup:[/b] this implementation uses build-specific native UI functions and signatures. Install a compatible release.
[/list]

